WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.041 --> 00:00:03.294
Maxine:
The Palm Royale, the most exclusive club in the world,

00:00:03.294 --> 00:00:05.005
Maxine:
was where I belonged.

00:00:06.506 --> 00:00:07.716
♪♪

00:00:08.216 --> 00:00:09.634
Man:
How did you get past security?

00:00:09.843 --> 00:00:10.677
I came in the back.

00:00:11.261 --> 00:00:12.303
There are no doors on

00:00:12.345 --> 00:00:13.513
Man:
the back of the Palm Royale.

00:00:13.596 --> 00:00:14.264
Ugh!
[thud]

00:00:15.682 --> 00:00:16.808
I never said I used the door.

00:00:17.684 --> 00:00:18.893
♪♪

00:00:18.893 --> 00:00:21.104
Maxine:
I had only been in Palm Beach two weeks.

00:00:21.354 --> 00:00:22.230
We don't know you.

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:23.982
I'm Maxine Dellacorte.

00:00:23.982 --> 00:00:26.401
Maxine:
But I already knew the Palm Royale,

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:28.987
Maxine:
the most exclusive club in

00:00:28.987 --> 00:00:31.573
Maxine:
the world was where I belonged.

00:00:31.698 --> 00:00:32.991
Maxine:
Evelyn, you are the

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:34.451
woman to know in Palm Beach.

00:00:36.077 --> 00:00:37.245
I don't like you, Maxine.

00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:38.788
Dinah:
You're very good at

00:00:38.830 --> 00:00:39.748
making things awkward.

00:00:40.915 --> 00:00:42.250
Virginia:
I don't concern myself with the

00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:43.835
shenanigans of vapid poons.

00:00:43.960 --> 00:00:44.210
[glasses clink]

00:00:44.252 --> 00:00:45.295
♪♪

00:00:45.378 --> 00:00:46.463
Dinah:
What is Evelyn wearing?

00:00:46.671 --> 00:00:47.297
Sleeves.

00:00:47.380 --> 00:00:48.465
[Hahahaha!]

00:00:48.548 --> 00:00:49.299
♪♪

00:00:49.340 --> 00:00:51.176
Do you know anything about rich people?

00:00:51.426 --> 00:00:52.510
I parked in the lawn.

00:00:53.636 --> 00:00:54.387
Norma:
Robert! 

00:00:54.429 --> 00:00:58.183
Shake me another martini, and then let's play doctor.

00:00:59.350 --> 00:01:00.351
Do you work, Maxine?

00:01:00.602 --> 00:01:00.935
God, no.

00:01:01.102 --> 00:01:01.770
You want to work?

00:01:01.895 --> 00:01:02.353
God, no.

00:01:02.729 --> 00:01:04.147
Linda:
You really want all this?

00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:05.065
More than anything I've

00:01:05.065 --> 00:01:06.357
ever wanted in my whole life.

00:01:06.649 --> 00:01:07.692
I'd like to take a few pictures.

00:01:08.359 --> 00:01:09.986
Maxine, you're the lead story!

00:01:10.820 --> 00:01:13.198
Maxine:
I see us all as one sisterhood.

00:01:14.532 --> 00:01:18.078
[LAUGHTER]

00:01:18.870 --> 00:01:21.081
♪Are people looking for something new?♪

00:01:21.790 --> 00:01:22.499
Evelyn:
Let me tell you

00:01:22.499 --> 00:01:24.250
Evelyn:
a little something about the Palm Royale.

00:01:24.459 --> 00:01:25.376
It's a nightmare.

00:01:25.877 --> 00:01:27.295
And that's all thanks to you.

00:01:28.379 --> 00:01:29.631
Don't underestimate a Dellacorte.

00:01:29.964 --> 00:01:30.548
I would never.

00:01:30.715 --> 00:01:34.052
♪♪

00:01:34.135 --> 00:01:35.970
Palm Beach is just a shell game.

00:01:36.513 --> 00:01:37.472
Linda:
Everybody has a secret.

00:01:37.889 --> 00:01:39.349
You two behave.

00:01:40.308 --> 00:01:41.392
Robert:
You don't have to have money.

00:01:41.559 --> 00:01:42.477
The blackmail is right here.

00:01:42.811 --> 00:01:44.062
You don't know the half of it.

00:01:44.813 --> 00:01:47.690
What in fires of hell’s pits is going on here?!

00:01:47.732 --> 00:01:48.483
Off we go.

00:01:48.650 --> 00:01:57.534
♪♪

00:01:57.575 --> 00:01:58.701
Linda:
You’re in over your head.

00:01:58.910 --> 00:02:00.245
And girl, you don’t even know it.

00:02:01.663 --> 00:02:03.373
I am never in over my head.

00:02:03.623 --> 00:02:05.291
It would be disrespectful to my hairdresser.

00:02:05.416 --> 00:02:06.126
Touché.

00:02:06.251 --> 00:02:10.505
 ♪♪

00:02:10.839 --> 00:02:12.006
Maxine:
In Palm Beach,

00:02:12.257 --> 00:02:14.300
Maxine:
a secret is like a loaded gun.

00:02:14.425 --> 00:02:15.176
No, no, no no.

00:02:15.385 --> 00:02:15.844
[Punches]

00:02:16.302 --> 00:02:18.388
Maxine:
You never know when it will go off...

00:02:18.429 --> 00:02:19.139
Maxine:
Ahh!

00:02:19.180 --> 00:02:20.140
♪♪

00:02:20.181 --> 00:02:22.267
 Maxine:
…Or who it might hit.

00:02:22.350 --> 00:02:23.601
♪♪

00:02:23.643 --> 00:02:24.185
[Gunshot]

00:02:24.352 --> 00:02:24.811
Ladies!

00:02:24.811 --> 00:02:25.478
[fingers snap]

00:02:26.104 --> 00:02:28.064
I know, yes, surprised to see me, 

00:02:28.106 --> 00:02:29.607
considering you left me for dead.

00:02:29.649 --> 00:02:35.446
♪♪

